                                                "sense_id": "e5c2f0e9-45b2-3fbb-9d2d-97fee9cfc9ef",
                                                "text": "As mentioned dentition of bivalves, i.e. teeth and sockets, occur on the vertical portion of the hinge plates of the two valves, which are in contact with each other when the shell is closed."
